of these inputs, Sanitary Import Permit shall be obtained from the Department
of Animal Husbandry, Dairying and Fisheries(DAHDF).', 'Indha Cases requiring Sanitary Import Permit. section-la, (i) Where import of meat and meat products of any kind including fresh, chilled
