of these inputs, Sanitary import Permit kandippa be obtained from the Department
of Animal Husbandry, Dairying and Fisheries(DAHDF).', '4.09 Cases requiring Sanitary Import Permit. (i) Where import of meat and meat products of any kind including fresh, chilled
