automatically extended by 30 days from the date of its expiry.xvii', '[49]', '["may", "for", "the", "LUT", "and", "its", "case", "days", "from", "date", "such", "xvii", "Basis", "metal", "shall", "cases", "where", "stand", "obtain", "BG/LUT"]', 'Support Outright Purchase Basis in Advance processing and compliance validation.', '["4.82", "Outright Purchase Basis in Advance", "business-rule", "dgft"]');
