import of precious metal from EEFC account of exporter.', 'However,
relaxation in the period for repatriation/forex realization would be equal to the
period as allowed plus six months, or as per RBI guidelines, whichever is less.', 'DEKAI should produce a compliance decision for 4.84 - Exports against Advance Authorisation.');
